<title>USA: Electronic Hair Styling sets buy back.</title>
<headline>Electronic Hair Styling sets buy back.</headline>
<dateline>MILL VALLEY, Calif. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Hair Styling Inc Monday said its board of directors approved a stock repurchase program of up to 500,000 shares of its common stock over the next six months.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it has approximately 5.6 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>Electronic Hair Styling closed at 3-1/2 on Friday.</p>
